flowchart LR
    User[Admin / Manager / Agent] --> HTTP[EC2 public HTTP URL]
    HTTP --> EC2[Amazon EC2 t3.micro<br/>ca-central-1]
    EC2 --> Docker[Docker runtime]
    Docker --> App[FastAPI container<br/>NexusLead AI]
    Docker --> DB[(PostgreSQL container<br/>nexuslead-postgres volume)]
    Docker --> Uploads[(Uploads volume)]
    App --> Logs[CloudWatch logs<br/>/nexuslead-ai/ec2]

    GitHub[GitHub repository] --> Actions[GitHub Actions CI/CD]
    Actions --> ECR[Amazon ECR<br/>nexuslead-ai]
    ECR --> Puller[EC2 deploy cron<br/>pull latest every 10 min]
    Puller --> App

    EC2 --> Health[/health and /metrics/]
